# Google OAuth client IDs (https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials)
# Create an "iOS" client (bundle id of your dev build), an "Android" client
# (package name + SHA-1), and a "Web application" client. The web client id is
# also used for the Expo Go proxy flow. Restart the dev server after editing:
# npx expo start -c
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID=
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ANDROID_CLIENT_ID=
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID=

# Apple Sign in with Apple needs no in-app key. For standalone builds it needs:
# - app.json: ios.usesAppleSignIn + expo-apple-authentication plugin (already set)
# - the Sign In with Apple capability on your Apple Developer bundle id.
